         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Practicing Addition with Typed Values\n\nIn this game, you solve a vertical addition by typing the values. The squares show the digit already in the column and help you see how many squares are missing to reach ten.\n\nType the digit that stays in the column in the box on the result row. When the sum reaches ten, type 1 in the carry box above the next order.",
